*  l3_arb_pred.sno - L-3 blast-radius probe (2026-08-12 s33).
*  ARB: p=3 n=5. oracle [abcde]; defect-formula [n,p+n)=[cde]. MEASURED [cde] = DEFECT.
*  PREDICTION STATED BEFORE MEASURING - do not 'simplify' the subject:
*  a success-expecting or same-answer subject re-hides this row (FINDING-08-12 s3).
        S = 'xy+abcdefg'
        S ANY('+') ARB . R 'f'                   :S(Y)F(N)
Y       OUTPUT = 'R=[' R ']'                     :(D)
N       OUTPUT = 'NOMATCH'
D       OUTPUT = 'DONE'
END
